Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 03:21:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): release partial remote claims after collection
 errors [daveey]

Per-row legacy alias reservations commit before later transcript reads. Preserve partial offers in the caller and release undelivered claims after collection failure, retaining delivered receipts. RED: ordinary and legacy same-holder retries lost the first card (2 failures); base legacy control passes. GREEN: owner delivery and rehome suites pass. Also cover malformed remote-ref board inference and correct transaction-read comment.
